  "prefLabel": "Ed 216.02 Contents of Explanation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 216.02 Contents of Explanation. The board shall, within 90 days of receiving a request in accordance with Ed 216.01, provide a written response which:\n\n(a) Concisely states the meaning of the rule adopted;\n\n(b) Concisely states the principal reasons for and against the adoption of the rule in its final form; and\n\n(c) States, if the board did so, why the board overruled any arguments and considerations presented against the rule.\n\nSource. #8334-B, eff 4-23-05; ss by #10361-A, eff 6-15-13\n\nAPPENDIX\n\nRule | Statute\n\nEd 201 - 202 | RSA 541-A:30-a; RSA 541-A:31\n\nEd 203 | RSA 541-A:30-a\n\nEd 204.01 | RSA 21-N:11,III\n\nEd 204.02 | RSA 189:14-a\n\nEd 205 | RSA 541-A:38\n\nEd 206 | RSA 541-A:30-a\n\nEd 207 - 208 | RSA 21-N:4,III\n\nEd 209 | RSA 541-A:30-a\n\nEd 210 - 213 | RSA 21-N:4,III\n\nEd 214 | RSA 541-A:16,I(b)(3)\n\nEd 215.01 | RSA 541-A:16,I(b)(3); 541-A:4\n\nEd 215.02-.215.03 | RSA 541-A:16,I(c)\n\nEd 216 | RSA 541-A:11,VII",
